                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Final action on a recommendation to dismiss a teacher or to fix terms under which a teacher may be returned to duty requires an affirmative vote of the majority of the Board. Appeal of the decision of the Board shall be as provided by law.",
            "block_bbox": [
                77,
